===Etymology===
[[File:The Ministers and their cronies off to Botany Bay, and the Dorchester men returning - Grant's Political drama (1834-1835), no.33 - BL.jpg|thumb|300px|{{w|Charles Jameson Grant}}, ''The Ministers and Their Cronies off to [[Botany Bay]], and the Dorchester Men Returning'' (1834–1835), a [[political cartoon]] depicting the {{w|Tolpuddle Martyrs}}—who had been [[sentence#Verb|sentenced]] to [[penal]] [[transportation]] to [[Australia]] after a [[labour#Noun|labour]] [[dispute#Noun|dispute]]—returning to England following their [[pardon#Noun|pardon]] ''(background''), and suggesting that [[government]] “[[minister#Noun|ministers]] and their [[crony|cronies]]” ''(foreground)'' should be sent there instead.]]

